      "title": "Ciena CEO Sells 2,952 Shares for $1.3 Million",
      "summary": "Ciena CEO Gary B. Smith sold 2,952 shares worth approximately $1.3 million on August 17, 2026, under a pre-established Rule 10b5-1 trading plan adopted in October 2025. The sale represents only 1% of his total holdings, with the CEO retaining 246,030 shares valued at $109.5 million. The transaction is characterized as routine and non-concerning for investors, occurring after the stock gained 390% over the past 12 months amid strong company performance with 30% revenue growth and 61% expected earnings growth.",
